---
layout: layouts/base.njk
permalink: /projects/
title: Projects
navSection: work
description: "Projects by Lee Chun Yong: security, systems and applied cryptography, from coursework, internships and a home server."
---
<main class="wrap">
  <header class="page-head">
    <h1>Projects</h1>
    <p>Coursework, internships and personal infrastructure, newest first. Mostly security, systems and applied cryptography, with some hardware along the way.</p>
  </header>
  <ol class="ledger">
    {%- for project in collections.projects %}
    <li>
      <a class="ledger-row" href="{{ project.url }}">
        <span class="ledger-no">{{ collections.projects | itemNo(project.url) }}</span>
        <span class="ledger-main">
          <span class="ledger-title">{{ project.data.title }}</span>
          <span class="ledger-summary">{{ project.data.summary }}</span>
          <span class="ledger-tags meta">{{ project.data.stack | join(" · ") }}</span>
        </span>
        <span class="ledger-context">{{ project.data.role }}</span>
        <span class="ledger-date meta">{{ project.data.period }}</span>
      </a>
    </li>
    {%- endfor %}
  </ol>
</main>
